===Verb===
{{ru-verb|потащи́ться|pf|impf=тащи́ться}}

# to [[trail along]]
# to [[drag]] [[oneself]] [[along]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[е́ле]] '''потащи́ться'''|drag one's feet; be barely able to walk}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[trail along]] ''(behind)'', to [[follow]]
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[go]], to [[drag]] [[oneself]] ''(to a place)''
# {{infl of|ru|потащи́ть||pass}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4c|потащи́ться}}

